# 🔐 Permission System

The project implements **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)** using binary permissions.

| Permission | Value |
|------------|------:|
| Show Client List | 1 |
| Add Client | 2 |
| Delete Client | 4 |
| Update Client | 8 |
| Find Client | 16 |
| Transactions | 32 |
| Manage Users | 64 |
| Full Access | -1 |

Permissions are combined using **bitwise operators**, allowing a single integer to represent multiple privileges efficiently.

---

# 💾 Data Storage

## Client Record

```
AccountNumber#//#PinCode#//#Name#//#Phone#//#Balance
```

Example

```
A150#//#1111#//#John Smith#//#0531234567#//#25000.00
```

---

## User Record

```
Username#//#Password#//#Permission
```

Example

```
Admin#//#1234#//#-1
```

