# ⚙️ Getting Started

## Prerequisites

- C++11 Compiler
- GCC / MSVC / Clang
- Windows Operating System

---

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Bank-System.git
```

```bash
cd Bank-System
```

---

## Compile

```bash
g++ BankSystemFile.cpp -o BankSystem
```

---

# 🚀 Running the Project

Execute

```bash
BankSystem.exe
```

Administrator account

```
Username: Admin
Password: 1234
```

